Package: wompwomp
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-09-06
Title: Optimizing Alluvial Plots
Authors@R: c(person("Joseph", "Rich", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jmrich@caltech.edu", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1400-8479")), person("Conrad", "Oakes", role = "aut", email = "coakes@caltech.edu"), person("Lior", "Pachter", role = "aut", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9164-6231")))
Description: Sort k-partite graphs with node order, layer order, and node grouping optimized with a heuristic to (nearly) minimize edge crossings, and render the result as an alluvial plot. Useful for improving visualizations with alluvial plots by "untangling" the graphs.
